  <section class="service-block" id="fitting" style="padding-top:0">
    <h2 class="h3">Fitting and test rides</h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Every SENDA is fitted at a partner studio before it is built, so size, stem and bar width are right from the first ride. Test-ride days are announced on the list first.</p>
      <a class="linkline mt-4" href="#contact">Ask for a fitting</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="service-block" id="faq">
    <h2 class="h3">Questions</h2>
    <div class="faq">
      <details><summary>When will the first bikes be delivered?</summary><p>First deliveries are planned for 2027. Every reservation gets a delivery window, and we write if anything moves.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What can I order first?</summary><p>ORMA Momentum 45, our carbon road wheelset. The first clothing follows in spring 2027.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do ORMA wheels fit my bike?</summary><p>Momentum 45 is made for disc brakes and 12 mm thru-axles. The compatibility table on the wheelset page covers the details.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you deliver outside Switzerland?</summary><p>We start in Switzerland. EU delivery follows once the first series is out.</p></details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="service-block" id="contact">
    <h2 class="h3">Contact</h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Write to <a href="mailto:info@sendabikes.com">info@sendabikes.com</a>. We answer within one working day.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

