      <h2 class="h3">Pre-order and delivery</h2>
      <div class="prose"><p>Bikes are reserved with a refundable deposit of CHF 300; the balance is paid by bank transfer or QR invoice before delivery. Wheelsets, components and clothing on pre-order are paid at checkout. Every pre-order has a delivery window. Delivery is free in Switzerland.</p></div>
